cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.9.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact identity between the native real-camera
  and Genuine zero, the sharp critical cutoff-tail and collective raw-energy
  expansions, and the exact logarithmic first and second cutoff jets generated
  by the factor M^(-s-1). Version 0.9.0 proves the exact transport of supplied
  scaled value, first-derivative, and second-derivative remainder estimates to
  cutoff-jet errors with factors (1+||log M||) and (1+||log M||)^2. It does not
  yet manufacture those three analytic estimates for the exact tail. Empirical
  cutoff-doubling campaigns remain discovery provenance rather than kernel
  assumptions.
keywords:
